se,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PBF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"910442d7-11d8-4c60-aabf-55fa5ca20232","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```function! Feed() abort\n  call feedkeys(\"foo\", 'n')\n  call feedkeys(\"\", 'nt')\n  call feedkeys(\"bar\", 'n')\n  call feedkeys(\"\", 'x')\n  call feedkeys(\"baz\", 'n')\nendfunction\ninoremap \u0026lt;C-j\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;call Feed()\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;```\nなんと、これで \u0026lt;C-j\u0026gt; すると `baz` だけが挿入されます。（謎）","ts":"1634020376.347100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fearful","count":1,"users":["U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TRcv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70623fa1-a570-446c-b2fc-069da3ea0141","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"研究すごい","ts":"1634018775.346700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bQdSu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58c8ddc1-b773-44f8-af55-5e29174db1e2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Ignoreべんり","ts":"1634018580.346500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1GA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ad42cf1-5179-4f7f-8446-53a0dd726fcb","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```  call feedkeys(\"\\\u0026lt;Ignore\u0026gt;\", 'nx')```\nこれ、もしかしたら便利かもしれません。調査を続けます。（そのうち。。。）","ts":"1634018260.346100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GKIk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb093732-bdcd-4ecf-a2bd-c44464c2460b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これは","ts":"1634018245.345700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"19s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4842c6b5-ce22-483a-999a-f74446b111eb","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```call feedkeys('…', 'n')\ncall feedkeys('…', 'nt')\ncall feedkeys('…', 'n')```\nってやっても、3 番目の feedkeys も `t` フラグ付きとして扱われる気がしていてかなり辛い気持ちになっています。。。","ts":"1634016301.345400","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1634016311.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G02Xn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7439d80-5f33-42b2-87cd-4c647fc0ff85","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```function! s:log(...) abort\n  echomsg string(a:000)\nendfunction\n\nautocmd CursorMovedI * call timer_start(0, { -\u0026gt; s:log('CursorMovedI', reltime()) })\nautocmd TextChangedI * call timer_start(0, { -\u0026gt; s:log('TextChangedI', reltime()) })\nautocmd CursorMoved * call timer_start(0, { -\u0026gt; s:log('CursorMoved', reltime()) })\nautocmd CursorMoved * call timer_start(0, { -\u0026gt; s:log('TextChanged', reltime()) })\n\ncall feedkeys(\"\\\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;set eventignore=all\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\", 'n')\ncall feedkeys(\"iaiueo\\\u0026lt;Left\u0026gt;\\\u0026lt;Left\u0026gt;\\\u0026lt;Left\u0026gt;\\\u0026lt;Left\u0026gt;\\\u0026lt;Left\u0026gt;\\\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;\", 'n')\ncall feedkeys(\"\\\u0026lt;Right\u0026gt;X\\\u0026lt;Right\u0026gt;X\\\u0026lt;Right\u0026gt;X\\\u0026lt;Right\u0026gt;X\\\u0026lt;Right\u0026gt;X\", 'n')\ncall feedkeys(printf(\"\\\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;set eventignore=%s\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\", \u0026amp;eventignore), 'n')```\nこれで何も発生しない。というのは確認できたので、こちらのプラグインの問題で FA でよさそうです！","ts":"1634006878.344200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eg6m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50bd7d7e-ed6b-4ee4-8887-4b1f3d3104d8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"プラグインが発行するすべての feedkeys の前後に `\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;set eventignore=all\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;` と復元処理を挟んで見ましたがだめそうでした。","ts":"1634006614.343700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hdYpO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07ac41d5-3265-4ff3-84de-605cd7ed951d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"さっきの `\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;` で `'backspace'` を変えているところで一緒に変えるのだとダメ?","ts":"1634006571.342900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bIJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9508cb78-4739-4924-9ae7-c54aa5396a02","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"うーん。プラグインの利用方法的に、eventignore を復元したあとにイベントが飛ぶような処理になってしまっているのかな。。。謎。","ts":"1634006477.342300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R4DrV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4e970d7-b9ff-488f-a7c4-41b4b473e673","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```set eventignore=all\nautocmd CursorMovedI * echomsg string(['CursorMovedI', reltime()])\nautocmd TextChangedI * echomsg string(['TextChangedI', reltime()])\nautocmd CursorMoved * echomsg string(['CursorMoved', reltime()])\nautocmd TextChanged * echomsg string(['TextChanged', reltime()])```\nたしかに、これで何も echomsg されないのを確認しました。。。自分のテスト方法が悪かったのかもしれません。","ts":"1634006292.341800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J1G/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d917dbb-6ba7-43b1-b7e1-d8c08d6a2ca5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私の環境だと止まってます。8.2.3469","ts":"1634006188.341300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yVq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ca541b3-2b05-44bf-8c59-85b03640f577","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"いやしかし、\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt; がここまで便利だとは、、、まさか undo も dot-repeat も影響与えずにノーマルモードコマンド打てるなんて。","ts":"1634006003.340700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=tg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50e47dfc-1c8f-4074-bd2b-d846ec919e88","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"やはり CursorMoved 止められない気がします。","ts":"1634005956.339900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PmDNI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c28a2147-1355-4bb0-b978-d82984341018","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"というか、もしそうなら自前プラグインが発行するすべての feedkeys を eventignore=all でラップすれば最\u0026amp;高になれる説がでてきている。","ts":"1634005718.339600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m6l5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"164cae98-c580-413d-b6e2-76fa223afc61","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"むむ。であればやる価値があるかもしれない。。。","ts":"1634005685.338800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dhh9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2616d7f-d3e6-4530-8865-d101af875f54","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"いや、ちゃんと呼ばれなくなってる気がする","ts":"1634005613.338500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vfs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1f5d6c8-3da6-4763-a78c-2112bb99c665","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なん…だと…","ts":"1634005517.337900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6fh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e32de22c-fc62-4196-94f8-80452cb838df","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"TextChanged と CursorMoved は聖域なので noautocmd も eventignore も効かなかった記憶があります。","ts":"1634005506.337700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VaYk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66f43e3a-e65b-457a-83d3-b7934c49c70a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"足したら足したで困るプラグインもいそう(知らない間にカーソルが動いてた!? ってなる) のでやはりむずい…","ts":"1634005466.337200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"de0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bf047e3-4a66-4472-82ff-a845f34258d8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"CursorMoved からはにげられない！","ts":"1634005461.337100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0GI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85c0b5bc-82d4-48d3-b482-939b3eee6eb1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`set` に `eventignore=CursorMovedI` も足せば…","ts":"1634005422.336300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GPM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3acda4ec-690c-412f-b374-8d1294cd0b1a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そうだと思います。autocmd の取り扱いには注意しないとだめそうです。","ts":"1634005317.335700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qbth"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6bf6d3b-72db-45d3-a2f3-82d7e419d7b5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`CursorMovedI` 辺りには一応影響が出る…? 問題はないと信じたい","ts":"1634005237.335200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cxBH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29892990-2324-41cd-bd46-9c40db659b4d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これのいいところは、オプション変更のお掃除タイミングが安全であるというところです。（オプションが、ユーザの指定した値じゃない状態で二重に処理が発生して、不正な値でオプションが復帰してしまう。というのを防げているはず。autocmd 中は不正な値になっていそうではあるが。。。）","ts":"1634005156.334500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mLZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78777b00-649e-4b6e-94ed-e223151e4919","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"最終的に下記のようになりました。\n```let l:keys = []\nlet l:keys += [\"\\\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;set backspace=\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\"]\nlet l:keys += [repeat(\"\\\u0026lt;BS\u0026gt;\", 5)]\nlet l:keys += [printf(\"\\\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;set backspace=%s\\\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\", \u0026amp;backspace)]\ncall feedkeys(join(l:keys, ''), 'n')```","ts":"1634005052.333000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":5,"users":["U776661HA","U8996GYBF","U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL","U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o49"}]},{"client